Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 06 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:06.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.83,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's really out of focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:15.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, Kouki, stand together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.84,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.83,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Get ready! {lit, "I'm taking it (the photo)"}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:23.83,Sch1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\p1\pos(849,498)}m 0 0 l 120 0 120 500 0 500{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:23.83,Sch2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(848,303)}Elementary\N\N\NSchool\N\N\NEntrance\N\N\NCeremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.08,Sch3,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\p1\pos(849,498)}m 0 0 l 120 0 120 500 0 500{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.08,Sch4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(848,303)}Elementary\N\N\NSchool\N\N\NEntrance\N\N\NCeremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:29.07,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, I'll take one of you with Rin-chan now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.68,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Go on! She'll grow up in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.55,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have to hold on to these moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:44.35,Sch1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.4\p1\pos(885,583)}m 0 0 l 87 0 87 542 0 542{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:44.35,Sch5,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(884,435)}Elementary\N\N\NSchool\N\N\NEntrance\N\N\NCeremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:44.37,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, don't look so stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:23.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:23.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:45.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:55.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! How many times do I have to tell you not to leave my side like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:56.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're a young lady now, so start acting like one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.14,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:03.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:06.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we buy this for snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.53,0:03:09.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Snacks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought it looked good. {FUUUUUUU SO CUTE}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever had cereal before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think it's too big for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't mind buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you normally have that for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:30.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat candy with rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:31.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:36.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like candy, but you can have it as a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It goes with milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna have it for breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:43.95,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. It doesn't fill me up. {im still hungry after it}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:52.75,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put the cereal in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.21,MainLow,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.88,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're no good at that, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.09,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My hands are too slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.63,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're just like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.76,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.46,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Keep trying then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:13.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's walk where the cherry blossoms are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:14.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:17.49,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's warm out, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it big?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:30.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you say we plant something to\Ncommemorate your new start in elementary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"Commemorate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's like creating a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:39.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You and the tree would grow together every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have one myself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,At home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:46.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At my parents' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:50.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When I was born, they planted a fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:53.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And when my sister was born, they planted a tea olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are fragrant olives the ones that smell nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:04:59.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what a tea olive is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:03.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the tea olive doesn't really have a nice smell or many flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:09.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,which is why my sister would complain and try to steal the ones from my tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:13.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When I offered to trade, she would just scream and say she didn't want hand-me-downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:18.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hold on, those aren't very fond memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:20.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why am I trying to repeat it with Rin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:25.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if we do end up getting one, how about a pretty one or one with lots of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe one that bears fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want a plum tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A plum tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:33.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, a plum tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.57,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I have the seeds for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want to plant them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:43.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat all the plums I want then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Only if they're ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:50.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking we could plant a tree that's about as tall as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.03,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No plum tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:56.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, a tree doesn't grow as fast as a morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's like they say, "Good things\Nwill come to those who wait."  {the original Japanese proverb says "Three years for peaches, eight years for persimmons." which conveys the same meaning, but having that by itself makes no sense, and i hate TL notes. we can put an explanation on website once ep is released}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"So don't be impatient!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Grandpa's kid, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.39,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What about plum trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What'll you do if it takes ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:15.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have a feeling you'll prefer fancy desserts by then.{\i0} {it's pretty common for Japanese high-school girls to love cake, sweets, etc.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}At least that's what I imagine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.51,0:06:20.30,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:23.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry, we won't be able to eat them for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.16,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:33.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Any deeper and it won't be able to sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:43.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're a spitting image of Grandpa, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hope it sprouts soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:46.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know what a ninja is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:54.53,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kouki-kun says he's going to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:59.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's said that ninjas jump over a hemp tree every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and while the tree gradually grows taller,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,they're able to jump to extraordinary heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try that with your plum tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:14.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:18.90,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Was that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:19.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:24.65,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How tall does a plum tree grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.36,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will it reach our roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:29.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:39.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ten more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:47.14,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it'll sprout tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:49.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:53.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:59.96,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My teacher said someone from home has to look over my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:02.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't have this when I was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:10.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's right. It says I have to sign.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:16.81,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.81,0:08:18.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:20.11,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:21.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.59,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, put this whistle on my knapsack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:37.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If a stranger tries to talk to you, blow really hard into the whistle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.30,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then run into the first house you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:42.09,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Or a store!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:44.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, school!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:58.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.53,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.49,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:06.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget the milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:09.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I eat some of it just like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:10.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Dogs eat this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:21.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's made for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:22.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:24.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:27.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Humans aren't supposed to eat dog food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:35.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! It's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My rice balls are still number one though!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:42.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They sure are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.60,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your phone's ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:44.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:50.00,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:54.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry! Kouki was so excited he just couldn't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:57.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.12,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:00.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:58.53,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.53,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.45,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:09.21,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you're covered with seeds! {burr seeds - those things that stick to clothing. is it the same as 'nettle'?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you walk through the forest or something? {lit. did you walk through an animal trail or something}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.37,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:16.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what happened to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:18.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get a comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now your knapsack's got marks all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:31.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You used that stick to scrape home walls, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.07,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Can you read my mind?! {he says "Are you an ESPer"}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:38.57,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because you used to do it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go and get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.13,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:49.17,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:52.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:56.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:04.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you shouldn't blow it when nothing's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.09,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:14.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No one will come when you're really in trouble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.81,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:21.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.97,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.46,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.43,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:46.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We shouldn't go another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:49.47,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We're not! It's a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:56.56,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Ninjas always take shortcuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:58.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:05.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It keeps zig-zagging!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.06,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:29.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a shortcut otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:38.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:13.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He sure is a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:14.89,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:20.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess all boys are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.56,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:26.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All I said about ninja training was jumping over trees, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:27.36,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:38.43,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that plum tree is because I'm starting school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:45.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But you got a fragrant olive when you were born, so it's not the same, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:50.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I don't have something like a fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:53.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She sure is smart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:57.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Is her mother the type to plant a tree?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:01.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there's one at Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}True, Grandpa would do that.{\i0} {i.e. that's something Grandpa would do}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't remember seeing one, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:08.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:13.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And now Grandpa's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:18.83,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know about it, no one does, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:23.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I never should have told her about my fragrant olive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.39,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your elbows!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:43.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.82,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought I'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:15:00.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is from her school entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.56,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:05.50,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? A tree for Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:11.05,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, there is one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:12.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:15.81,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Or there was one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:21.39,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san was the one who planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:23.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:32.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to move that tree to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:34.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.33,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, what variety is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.61,0:15:40.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:46.00,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's still small, and its branches are thin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:48.00,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you really a manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:56.48,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't draw many maps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which way's north?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:15:59.45,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:01.76,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if the sun rises in the west...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong! It rises in the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:08.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please just draw the street that's in front of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.88,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Right, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.98,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I have some work to do, so I'll be leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:17.46,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for calling you when you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:44.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I have a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:48.35,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa must have planted something for you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:50.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:56.20,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And even if he didn't, we'll just plant a new one to celebrate your entrance into school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:59.21,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,A six year old tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.63,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to see Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:04.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:09.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:11.75,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it's thirty years old, just like Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:14.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi grew up as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fragrant olive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.79,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.58,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And this one is Kazumi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:24.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A tea olive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.06,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:32.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember seeing a big tree in Grandpa's backyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:33.81,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:43.27,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's my tea olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:45.33,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:51.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This tree...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:56.81,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa planted it when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So, you have the same kind of tree as Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.38,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:12.57,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I always used to measure my\Nheight against it when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:16.76,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I treasured it so much that I did the same for my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:20.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Was that a tea olive?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:23.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi measure his height too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.43,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:35.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Long before you and I first met...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:36.68,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.05,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Its leaves are the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:45.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a six year old fragrant olive, just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.02,0:18:53.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.03,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I can jump over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:26.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to believe we didn't even know about Rin six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.70,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:31.12,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, we'll miss the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:32.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.67,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll walk you to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:40.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:45.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Long before you and I first met...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:59.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}you were already following in our footsteps.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.02,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:43.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:44.57,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:45.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:47.63,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a weird old man outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the old fart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.87,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Kouki-kun. That guy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:51.33,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:54.75,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:57.71,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's our neighbor, Matsui-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:00.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not a weird old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:04.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:11.05,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:16.52,Main,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be. I think I gave him a fright when I suddenly dropped by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:18.64,Main,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:21.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please, it was extremely rude of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:24.25,Main,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.25,0:22:25.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:33.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:37.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You took Rin with you when you ran from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:41.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? But he was wrong about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:44.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll worry a little less when Kouki's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.83,0:22:46.02,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean "a little"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean "a little"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:48.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:49.96,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late.
